flowchart LR
    CASE["Patient JSON<br/>Fictional adult, medication<br/>HLA results and treatment facts"]
    VALIDATE["Validate input<br/>Required fields and values<br/>Adult + first-time carbamazepine"]
    EVIDENCE["Read and validate evidence<br/>cpic.py<br/>Preserve source IDs and dates"]
    MATCH["Match in Python<br/>matching.py<br/>Results + recommendation conditions"]
    REPORT["Terminal report<br/>Applicable CPIC source text<br/>Missing facts, conditions, sources"]
    CPIC[("CPIC API<br/>Drug, linked guideline<br/>Recommendations, publications")]
    SAVED["Saved CPIC response<br/>Only with --snapshot<br/>Original retrieval date shown"]
    ERROR["Explicit error outcome<br/>No completed finding"]

    CASE --> VALIDATE --> EVIDENCE --> MATCH --> REPORT
    CPIC -->|Live by default| EVIDENCE
    SAVED -. "Explicit offline option" .-> EVIDENCE
    VALIDATE -->|Invalid or unsupported| ERROR
    EVIDENCE -->|Unavailable or invalid| ERROR
    MATCH -->|No unique matching record| ERROR

